### Authentication Endpoints
# Run this request first to obtain an access token for authenticated endpoints

### Request Token
# @name auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/authentication/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
# Capture the access token from the response
@access_token = {{auth.response.body.token}}
